      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "42",
      "locator": "paragraph 42",
      "text": "U.S. House Democratic Candidate for Arizona’s 8th District",
      "sha256": "03653a26a49db272324353d7c6cee92ad10820fbed9d74a61163544f1acbc035"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "4829f68de77fc5b1291353ec",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "43",
      "locator": "paragraph 43",
      "text": "“Brianna Westbrook’s life journey from a childhood riddled with poverty and addiction to becoming the working-class woman she is today has prepared her to fight authentically for social and economic justice courageously, and to represent the interests of the working-class people of our nation, not corrupt corporate America.”",
      "sha256": "9e47696cbb92a8ee3cb5a1a7f96220c8ca040dca0aa25abf822756c3c3fa42c6"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "75ca79ba90db796e8aea524f",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "44",
      "locator": "paragraph 44",
      "text": "Share your opinion",
      "sha256": "13a1995ec051fd291e6a103bdcf8a4ac96999ec7c3ce5454c64471d3917d3ab3"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "98a44a34be21873b0b865947",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "45",
      "locator": "paragraph 45",
      "text": "In your opinion, which issues most affect our community?",
      "sha256": "925fa9684eae9a87eaaa47f1a3f76e3a2ffbb8d3d2e1a1974930b8e98ef2f7f5"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "d8a05a4df48082267967d119",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "46",
      "locator": "paragraph 46",
      "text": "Healthcare Homelessness Education Infrastructure Taxes Economy Drug addiction Environment Medicare & Medicaid",
      "sha256": "b1dcb05d33f651f439fea54f3000f01791c6cbddd7af9b705567703e32bd4582"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "f1aff523e7ff1460186541b6",
