      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "53",
      "locator": "paragraph 53",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-02-06T13:54:28+00:00",
      "sha256": "c7e26822b5f8089120ffb24888d1385852537bc233bd9e026d8af452ed84fe8d"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "b05ca6f35f96417de8c557af",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "54",
      "locator": "paragraph 54",
      "text": "Our Legal System Wastes Valuable Resources Pursuing Recreational Marijuana Users",
      "sha256": "5d011a8b93c73de7c0bad397c20c3ebe2fd635bf53c5b19a853c70924d6d25ee"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "ef1594f4ad619cf5b3029050",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "55",
      "locator": "paragraph 55",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-02-06T13:54:28+00:00 February 6th, 2018 |",
      "sha256": "03d2fe935c37875640ddcfe86f2f02034028b108196823cdc968361ef6da705d"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "81eabddf8bc90516abe0b058",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "56",
      "locator": "paragraph 56",
      "text": "For several reasons I applaud Representatives Thomas Garrett (R-Va), Tulsi Gabbard (D-Hi), and Scott Taylor (R-Va), for cosponsoring H.R.1227 - Ending Federal Marijuana Prohibition Act of 2017. Our legal system wastes valuable resources pursuing recreational",
      "sha256": "4d1c01dd78965dc3fe0fbe883f02b3e64945921242d1458493e7e70578d6f1b6"
    },
    {
