      "index": "57",
      "locator": "paragraph 57",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-02-02T14:19:37+00:00",
      "sha256": "a80844a7788f380a91e1b2088586826473d37d19fd752116d11f92e9594fe0af"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19d41ebd89c4fca9468abe23",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "58",
      "locator": "paragraph 58",
      "text": "Brianna is Accessible – Voter Endorsement",
      "sha256": "c8ab3f0a850e07dc0c64f764e13b5a2a8a450d5fdc732ae607e83dc5fca8341c"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "576205c62156f3af6969ee26",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "59",
      "locator": "paragraph 59",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-02-02T14:19:37+00:00 February 2nd, 2018 |",
      "sha256": "8725142412ba86c9a213f7acd287f814727d87854c113111ead7cdade38d1489"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "49109de927ed6b294e7f9bd7",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "60",
      "locator": "paragraph 60",
      "text": "No matter your R, D, or I political affiliation, Brianna Westbrook is the right person to represent our congressional district. After we’ve endured years of Congress stealing our earned ‘entitlements’ and laughing about it, and seeing our Senators and Representatives",
      "sha256": "f7da4668000833c6d9313c0cc71ee987942a4c22a9c323be7ae70d9b54b45ba7"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "a70997cd590bc5fc32e9e261",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "61",
      "locator": "paragraph 61",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-01-31T12:35:03+00:00",
      "sha256": "bf436b1395024abb80400c4e531b0f2acabc42292d70af6febe3913dfec90617"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "8cec9021ab99d038f8dd4c72",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "62",
      "locator": "paragraph 62",
      "text": "We Must Pass a Clean Dream Act Now",
      "sha256": "ed1b5cf59d5be01b0dd2077f1e2d369dff245b8d93a19615c132d2dd04a12984"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "9aa7040dbf65088ca2f138be",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "63",
      "locator": "paragraph 63",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-01-31T12:35:03+00:00 January 31st, 2018 |",
      "sha256": "7982da87a681bac10d1704f4890e0f8cc18d2eaf67f02acff59122f20db9b19a"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "4a13d6b9c7ad96f24975f45e",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "64",
      "locator": "paragraph 64",
      "text": "“We cannot seek achievement for ourselves and forget about progress and prosperity for our community.” - Cesar Chavez Those who we call “DREAMers” haven’t just dreamt of achieving citizenship in the U.S. and keeping their",
      "sha256": "bbd230a988bcb361d9e6517a5377fd7a39a4decc3af1b8ae24004b0129922426"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "9cc4858e6df9e987e5353115",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "65",
      "locator": "paragraph 65",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-01-28T22:37:05+00:00",
      "sha256": "d60203fe400b0b14bc2b89711c4879583aa4e516f0b4563b110ef1b9f50f3fdd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "89282b80eaa2f05ed3cbaea8",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "66",
      "locator": "paragraph 66",
      "text": "Holocaust Remembrance",
      "sha256": "fc6124678d0f739c6d22367b4e736ec14d843ab9927a0161bf4029f3a775c453"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "23acf2505361c9e68acfa27d",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "67",
      "locator": "paragraph 67",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-01-28T22:37:05+00:00 January 28th, 2018 |",
      "sha256": "55c4f626c78c2d973c2bd41cbfd74a2b5d64ea18354b1555f0fdef3bb1b8b957"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "6bd4b5dda00e31292c00a329",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "68",
      "locator": "paragraph 68",
      "text": "Yesterday marked 73 years since the prisoners held captive in Poland’s Auschwitz death camp were liberated by the Soviet Army. The Holocaust Remembrance is marked annually with our heads bowed in reverence for six million",
      "sha256": "282216aec0c8e1d72edd1b4ce887f7604c8d0aa5e674d1cc6930623ebe2baece"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "5f2c6de0fdfa9be1387b3f26",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "69",
      "locator": "paragraph 69",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-01-26T23:47:26+00:00",
      "sha256": "68961f3726d63f4120db8f0570e292efdcc9335c968fd46816e76e4fb27db339"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "2969fd18a55aaa0e9431d8a9",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "70",
      "locator": "paragraph 70",
      "text": "Your Voter Questions Answered",
      "sha256": "7f4f7a0840c68e30d80a220e7eeda15f92c1a9afda50a178da4fc2a35bd6e7e5"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "230169e9f254457879002815",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "71",
      "locator": "paragraph 71",
      "text": "Brianna 2018-01-26T23:47:26+00:00 January 26th, 2018 |",
      "sha256": "426ef8c54a1340d58ecc8f401faba24e5d9198a86f272e4c58097597c4808826"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "5e55ef43f230c231a5c8e190",
      "document_id": "az18-westbrook-newsite",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "72",
      "locator": "paragraph 72",
      "text": "Brianna Westbrook: For a nation which boasts of being rooted in democracy, our voter turnout has been dismal in past years. Just 50% of the U.S. voting-age population cast ballots in the 2016 presidential election,",
      "sha256": "bc3471cd2c4573f51f8959cce54e49f53c693aaf9a5955b980393c14f641e2e6"
    },
    {
